In this folder we have data that will be used in the project. 

## `./raw` 

This folder contains data that is straight from the authors. It is available from the OSF at the following [[link]](https://osf.io/5bsp3/?view_only=). Annoyingly, you cannot download this data directly from OSF and into a project folder; instead, you've got to navigate using a web-browser and download into this file. 

Also included in `./raw` are the documentation that was shipped with the data. This includes things like initial variable names. 

## `./processed` 

This contains data that has been formatted from the `./raw` data. Specifically, it has had the code from `/raw/convert_data.R` run against it. 